{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend","id":1202960,"title":"A SFW thread where I read Arms of the Chosen to find: The perfect sword boyfriend!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-04T06:09:11-07:00","id":1202960,"title":"A SFW thread where I read Arms of the Chosen to find: The perfect sword boyfriend!","content":"<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mcMlXXx.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aMQYu7F.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Hello hello hello, this is the thread where I'll read Third Edition's shiny Artifact book so questions like is Gorgon the best sword husbando, should I marry All-Conquering Colossus, is it right and proper to love Unison will finally be answered. Plus writing more will improve my ridiculously bad English from what I heard.<br /> <br /> And I have always want to use a Jen rating to.....well....rate how I excited I am toward the thing that I am reading:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EAxdu8v.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>- It's NEGA-JEN: Which is worse than zero Jen since it's in the negative. This thing is probably so antithetical for me that I'm recoiling from pure horror, like the word sexy and Ketchup Carjack being anywhere near each other.<br /> <br /> - This place.......It has no Jen at all: It's zero Jen, so bland that I don't know what to write for this.<br /> <br /> - Not bad, should I kiss him or punch him??: Pretty good, but there is still something not quite right to make me go.....<br /> <br /> - I DUB THEE PREMIUM BEEFCAKE: My maiden's heart has been touched by the Artifact in question, ca...can you be my boyfriend?<br /> <br /> - De...Demetheus: This reaction is reserved only for thing that can make me feel the same way I feel toward Demetheus i.e <span style=\"color:#000000\">Pure Love</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 04-05-2018, 06:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":30}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T06:31:42-07:00","id":1202964,"title":"","content":"Of all the people reading or reviewing new Exalted books, I think that I'm most excited to see your take, Jen. Especially if that take comes with more art. XD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T06:46:23-07:00","id":1202976,"title":"","content":"Arrrggghh why does this have to be happening while I'm trying to read the Dragon-Blooded book?!<br /> <br /> Ohoho, dating sim Gorgon; fantastic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T07:10:50-07:00","id":1202988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend#post1202960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">should I marry All-Conquering Colossus</div> </div> </div> </div>You should not. She's <b>mine</b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T08:21:44-07:00","id":1203017,"title":"","content":"This will be awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T09:35:56-07:00","id":1203042,"title":"","content":"So first will be the book's cover:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kk2eWRG.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Which is...pretty disappointing. I love the perspective of the image and the meaning of the player finding a treasure trove of Artifact in this book like this lady founds her in the building. But the Artifacts depicted here are kinda sub-par in term of design.<br /> <br /> I know I know, Jen's ragging on about the art again, what's next? Creating threads with click baiting title??!!<br /> <br /> But seriously though, these weapons just looks so.......+1 sword to me, not really something that I would want my character to use. But on the other hand, demanding the artist to create 30+ weapons with distinctive designs is pretty nonsensical..... <br /> <br /> Though I kindaaaa wonder if instead of normal size weapons in the picture, it's REAL Daiklaive instead, and by that I mean fuck huge Grand Goremaul and Grimscythe. Big weapons means less will be on the display since they will take up more space in the image, but the artist can now focus on making each one having a unique looks. No bias here, but I wouldn't mind Gorgon taking up an entire row of display for itself.<br /> <br /> Sadly, I'll have to give the cover No Jen<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QLh7D8z.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 04-04-2018, 01:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T10:05:31-07:00","id":1203048,"title":"","content":"Ah, finally, the thread we've all been waiting for. I hope my own liveblog won't influence you too unduly, but at last count my possibly romanceable list came to... around six or seven I think? The soulsteel ones are particularly fruitful, though there are also my own tendencies to consider there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T18:02:47-07:00","id":1203211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1202988#post1202988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You should not. She's <b>mine</b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I always likes the idea that the All-Conquering Colossus shows a bit of personality by encouraging its owner to follow their dreams of romance, without speaking.<br /> <br /> Like if you take the field in your Orichalcum Death Walker, and you notice the object of your affections watching from the crowd, the ACC will pause, turn, point at the person in question, and flex... And during the fight will feel just SLIGHTLY lighter and more agile when you control it.<br /> <br /> No mechanical benefit, but enough to help the rider stunt a bit more while showing off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T18:25:23-07:00","id":1203221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203211#post1203211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I always likes the idea that the All-Conquering Colossus shows a bit of personality by encouraging its owner to follow their dreams of romance, without speaking.<br /> <br /> Like if you take the field in your Orichalcum Death Walker, and you notice the object of your affections watching from the crowd, the ACC will pause, turn, point at the person in question, and flex... And during the fight will feel just SLIGHTLY lighter and more agile when you control it.<br /> <br /> No mechanical benefit, but enough to help the rider stunt a bit more while showing off.</div> </div> </div> </div>Glorious Solar Falling Titan Prana.<br /> <br /> Also, I hate to say this out loud but the Exalted artwork is kinda... <span style=\"font-size:8px\">hit or miss maybe some of it isnthatgoodsometimes donthateme</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T18:51:34-07:00","id":1203231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203221#post1203221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Also, I hate to say this out loud but the Exalted artwork is kinda... <span style=\"font-size:8px\">hit or miss maybe some of it isnthatgoodsometimes donthateme</span></div> </div> </div> </div>Gonna go out on a limb and say that that's about as controversial an opinion as &quot;Lunars have been mechanically underwhelming&quot; or &quot;I like to ignore the first three chapters of 2e Infernals&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T09:47:44-07:00","id":1203435,"title":"","content":"It's the credit page! I think I realized some of the name.<br /> <br /> Only one studio is doing the artworks huh, at least the quality will be consistent instead of cake Lunar in one place and then DEATH RAY in another.<br /> <br /> Eh, what does Dauntless Bureau of the Flame Duck mean exactly? I can't quite see the connection between playtesting and flameducking?<br /> <br /> Sooooo is person in the Ronin section playtest the Kukla or is the Kukla just his nickname I wonder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T10:15:40-07:00","id":1203447,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203435#post1203435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the credit page! I think I realized some of the name.<br /> <br /> Only one studio is doing the artworks huh, at least the quality will be consistent instead of cake Lunar in one place and then DEATH RAY in another.<br /> <br /> Eh, what does Dauntless Bureau of the Flame Duck mean exactly? I can't quite see the connection between playtesting and flameducking?<br /> <br /> Sooooo is person in the Ronin section playtest the Kukla or is the Kukla just his nickname I wonder.</div> </div> </div> </div>They are referencing Vance's game &quot;Doom and Gloam&quot;. Where he tried a few artifacts out on them. Also, yeah, that Kukla, who also pops up as color commentary in the chat logs for that game. I think he also posted here the other day...<br /> <br /> edit: If you haven't read it yet, <a href=\"http://nobilis.me/doom-and-gloam\" target=\"_blank\">you should</a>. Rand's character is just as boy crazy as you, AND it's somewhat central to the plot. They even use romance novels as a plot device MULTIPLE TIMES.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":1542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","user":"MoroseMorgan","date":". 04-05-2018, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T11:13:39-07:00","id":1203459,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackwingedheaven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1202964#post1202964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of all the people reading or reviewing new Exalted books, I think that I'm most excited to see your take, Jen. Especially if that take comes with more art. XD</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I really hope that I can fulfill that expectation ~</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1202976#post1202976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Arrrggghh why does this have to be happening while I'm trying to read the Dragon-Blooded book?!</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1202976#post1202976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Ohoho, dating sim Gorgon; fantastic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I have always one to do this thread for some time now. But then the DB Kickstarter begins and now there are three Let Read threads, but my inner Jen can't be contained any longer or I'll explode into rainbow.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1202988#post1202988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You should not. She's <b>mine</b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> So I guess that it's time for a DUEL. The winner shall take the gigantic hand of this beautiful giant of mass destruction!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ellis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203048#post1203048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, finally, the thread we've all been waiting for. I hope my own liveblog won't influence you too unduly, but at last count my possibly romanceable list came to... around six or seven I think? The soulsteel ones are particularly fruitful, though there are also my own tendencies to consider there.</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> Just glancing through the appendix it seems like I'm more of a giant gauntlets and holy orichalcum person instead of soulsteel sword. Oooh how I wish for a soulsteel black leather armor so I don't seem like such a Solar fanboy...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203211#post1203211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I always likes the idea that the All-Conquering Colossus shows a bit of personality by encouraging its owner to follow their dreams of romance, without speaking.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Like if you take the field in your Orichalcum Death Walker, and you notice the object of your affections watching from the crowd, the ACC will pause, turn, point at the person in question, and flex... And during the fight will feel just SLIGHTLY lighter and more agile when you control it.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">No mechanical benefit, but enough to help the rider stunt a bit more while showing off.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting how I have a totally different view on Colossus. But I'll get to that later when I get to the Warstrider chapter, I have to conserve my energy for now...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203447#post1203447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">edit: If you haven't read it yet, <a href=\"http://nobilis.me/doom-and-gloam\" target=\"_blank\">you should</a>. Rand's character is just as boy crazy as you, AND it's somewhat central to the plot. They even use romance novels as a plot device MULTIPLE TIMES.</div> </div> </div> </div>That depend on what kind of boys does he like, I can only deal with so much bishonen in my entertainment...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 04-05-2018, 02:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T11:16:02-07:00","id":1203460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203221#post1203221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Glorious Solar Falling Titan Prana.<br /> <br /> Also, I hate to say this out loud but the Exalted artwork is kinda... <span style=\"font-size:8px\">hit or miss maybe some of it isnthatgoodsometimes donthateme</span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I still can't decide which is my favorite in Arms: the <i>red jade</i> warstrider that is depicted in a dull greyish-brown color, or the illustration for Five Edicts Dominion, which... has to be seen to be believed.<br /> <br /> (And I say this as someone who generally <i>likes </i>the art shift from earlier editions!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T11:42:14-07:00","id":1203472,"title":"","content":"IIRC Rand's character is into dudely dudes, no waifs may apply.<br /> <br /> Also, an artifact based on his character made it into Arms. Sun's Brush.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T14:28:34-07:00","id":1203526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> IIRC Rand's character is into dudely dudes, no waifs may apply.<br /> <br /> Also, an artifact based on his character made it into Arms. Sun's Brush. </div> </div> </div>Oooh, he likes beefcake huh, since boy-crazy makes me think about yaoi with pointy chins and ridiculously thin men.....<br /> <hr /><br /> Now for the first chapt...Wait, the Introduction isn't Chapter One? I guess I just call it The Introduction then.<br /> <br /> Okay, I have to confess that I have never read those italic sentences at the start of each chapter. Since they are quotes from books that I have never read before so I figure that the joke/ hidden meaning/intent will just fly over my head anyway. But since this is a Let's Read...<br /> <br /> And well, I'm so happy that marrying your Artifact is encouraged by the book ~(\u00b4\u03c9\uff40)~<br /> <br /> After Googling the book's name, this novel is, like, super ancient if I'm seeing the publishing date right. Which means that the protagonist is a dude, so the sword is defaulted to a female pronounce \u0ca5\u0434\u0ca5<br /> <br /> But how do you make the sentence not weird if both characters are the same sex though? Repeating the word groom/bride a second time just sounds kinda strange in my head.<br /> <br /> Also, that Swordbearer's cover has a really hot guy on a dragon. Or is it a woman, kinda hard to know with the helmet on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-06T06:56:58-07:00","id":1203813,"title":"","content":"It's time to read the actual introduction.Yay, real-world myths, but I only know one of them orz<br /> <br /> And there are weapons from the myths too, and it's such a coincidence to see Circe's name since I keep thinking about Medea/Circe when picturing my Zenith in term of personalities and ways of doing things.<br /> <br /> And then we get to the Exalted's examples, though I don't really have the same excitement when reading the previous paragraphs though, I think it's because they don't have the same histories like Circe or Baba Yaga.<br /> <br /> Oooooh, I just noticed that in the real world examples, the majority of characters are men, while the example of Exalted has women as the majority. I kinda wish that one of them is a witch though, in keeping with the Baba Yaga and Circe examples above.<br /> <br /> Waaaaaaaait, Laughing Mirror is not Mirror Flag &gt;__&lt; So I do have the memory of a goldfish after all......<br /> <br /> Emeroda has to die though \u0628_\u0628 Sorry, but nobody hurt my poor poor Wong Bongerok and live. I <i>will </i>protect the sexy men of Creation!<br /> <br /> As for the sidebar, my thoughts are already aligned with it so I didn't quite have the same impact. <div align=\"center\"> <hr /></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Suggested Resource. Fun trivia, do you know that the Ramayana spreads from India all the way to South East Asia: Ramakien (Cambodia), Pram Dit Pram Lak (Ch\u0103m), Kakawin Ramayana (Indonesia), Phra Lak Phra Lam (Laos), Hikayat Seri Rama (Malaysia), Manaraw (Philippines), Ramakian (Thailand), even Vietnam with a heavy Sinic culture has its own version (D\u1ea1 Xoa V\u01b0\u01a1ng i.e Yaksha King). It's kinda sad though, that the Ramayana is constantly suggested as an Exalted resource, but I have yet to see any artworks with Indian themes in it, hopefully future material on the South will remedy that.<br /> <br /> My language has tones so I can type T\u00e1in easily, dohohohoho. The Dadga and a harp huh, as a Supernal Performance, I shall google his name. And Holly Molly, <i>he is hot, </i>whether he's a chubby dad or a serenity grandpa ~(\u25cf\u00b4\u03c9\uff40\u25cf)~ C\u00fa Chulainn is so overexposed that I let out a big Meeeeeeh when I read about him, Lugh sounds like a pretty boy for some reasons, oh, he's indeed a pretty longhair blondie according to google, pass.<br /> <br /> Yeaaaah, I have no ideas what these novel are. Though just looking at the covers, I can kinda imagine the aesthetic that early Exalted was trying to aim for now. Very...umm....dirty and weird looking? I can't explain it very well, but it evokes a down-to-earth and gritty adventures, desolated ruins and depressed atmosphere, and the characters are just so strange and out-there, kinda reminds of me Exalted's hell actually.<br /> <br /> Doctor Strange, absolute no interested in neither the character nor the film.<br /> <br /> Witchblade, I honestly only interested in the series when the character is a man, okay, that sounds super sexism. But I just want to look at a super ripped dude having his cloths being....well....ripped apart by a sentient skintight armor. Please don't judge me....<br /> <br /> Bleach is Bleach, I don't even know how the series ends since I stop caring when they go to rescue orange hair girl. That big furry captain is totally husband material though.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fate/Zero is so pretentious&quot; is what I though even if I haven't watched a single episode, I just want to Heaven Thunder Hammer every characters in the series to be honest, I don't like any of them in term of personality or appearance....Okay, that's is just Nega-Jen controlling me to type that dreadful sentence, since Iskander is the highest quality beefcake. But that the problem though, I only like him for his look, his personality is just pure eeeeeh for me, masculine men who constantly puffing their chest like that is a total nope.<br /> <br /> Finally something I like, By the Name of the Sun, I shall HEART-EATING PALM YOU! Though I never realized that Sailor Moon has legendary Artifacts, probably because they use them so much that I kinda blur them out of my memory.<br /> <br /> Vision of Escaflowne huh, I don't care much for Warstrider so my mind always blackout when I see people recommend it for Exalted. I do remember hating it when I watched in on Animax though. I mean, what the hell is wrong with these people nose???<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/baXDUSE.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I want to Thunder Heaven Hammer everybody in this picture. Especially purple guy.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3zueO31.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The design in this anime suuuuucks as.....Wait, finally some fucking hot men. These robots are kinda handsome actually, way better looking than those ugly Gundams. If Warstriders are supposed to look like this, there is a very big chance that I'll become a polygamist, so many robot husbands to choose from....<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: