er\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1234694#post1234694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can use voice, or text. If you'll get on Discord and PM me your info, I'll invite you to a text game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s okay, not being able to play actually doesn\u2019t bother me at all for some reasons, and I get super nervous when talking in private chat. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m really thankful for the offer though, it\u2019s not that often I meet such nice people on the Internet :3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T11:19:07-07:00","id":1234713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1234689#post1234689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nooo, it's some kind of voice chat for gamer according to Google, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Discord is pretty much a modern IRC. It's a chat software, there's chat rooms, with sub-rooms, and there's voice channels. Get into the exalted discord, c'mon!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T07:28:36-07:00","id":1234945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1234702#post1234702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It\u2019s okay, not being able to play actually doesn\u2019t bother me at all for some reasons, and I get super nervous when talking in private chat.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m really thankful for the offer though, it\u2019s not that often I meet such nice people on the Internet :3</div> </div> </div> </div>It wouldn't hurt to get into the Exalted Discord anyway. There's over a thousand members so you may never get into a one-to one setting. The live chat nature makes it easy to have conversations in real time or to speak to the developers, and the also discuss inspirational art, other games character builds the setting and loads more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-19T09:15:39-07:00","id":1236798,"title":"","content":"Heaven and Earth Gauntlets, it\u2019s a Smashfist made from Orichalcum, please be good, if a golden smashy smashy weapon can\u2019t turn me on, then all hope is lost with this book :\u2019((((<br /> <br /> I wonder if the full trinity of Heaven, Earth and Man has ever appeared in Exalted? The idiom \u5929\u6642\u5730\u5229\u4eba\u548c is always my favorite, tell your student that both Heaven and Earth\u2019s favor has run out, so the only thing that a sifu can do now to save the city is to accumulate Man and watch your student blushes with confident ~&lt;3<br /> <br /> Celestial Exalted siblings\u2026\u2026??? I would prefer if such a thing never happened in Creation tbh, other family members are fine though, father and son trying to kill each other is my favorite plot, but only if both of them are super hot.<br /> <br /> Mostath first appearance in Third Edition is to be worfed, how sad. I always like his design, but his write-up is super boring, I read it but no plothook appears in my head which is a shame since he\u2019s a giant mammoth mountain.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s kind of strange that all the feats in both here and previous Artifact are performed solo, no mention whatsoever of Circle, teammates or army. Does Exalted just tend to fly alone in canon or something?<br /> <br /> The Gauntlets are craft in the Broken Blade Concordat era. This is the wiki definition of it<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A <b>concordat</b> is a convention between the Holy See and a sovereign state that defines the relationship between the Catholic Church and the state in matters that concern both, i.e. the recognition and privileges of the Catholic Church in a particular country and with secular matters that impact on church interests.<br /> I wonder if it has any significant or is the book just used it as a cool sounding word. </div> </div> </div>Tssk tssk tssk, there is no mention of the weapon size nor any artworks, I would have been so much better for Heartsong to sacrifice itself so I see what HaEG looks like. I just gonna imagine it as being fucked huge then, only a man wearing gauntlets as big and tall as himself is allowed to princess carrying me.<br /> <br /> The attunement bonus is so simple but I like it so much, you know, a Solar with Supernal Brawl is quite Clash-happy when they turn into Akuma Oni <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Falling Star Fist\u2019s fluff makes me think it will be a shockwave effect at first, but punching the enemies away from the battlefield works for me too.<br /> <br /> Why do you need to halt mountain? It\u2019s not like they can mov\u2026..Ooh, so this is an example of Evocations arising from the user\u2019s legend, but the effect doesn\u2019t exactly reflect the Charm name or the legend, isn\u2019t it? Something like Athletic-related would be more fitting I think.<br /> <br /> Brawl does lack a wither Clash charm so Comet-Diverting Guard is a nice addition, not sure how useful it\u2019s it compare to those in the Corebook though since my mechanic skill is non-existence.<br /> <br /> Oh, a rare two-words Charm, Nova Breaker, it looks super nice when used too, I can\u2019t resist Tron lines (too bad it\u2019s only on the arms). And prismatic means colorful, right? So you knock someone down and then smash them with a rainbow homosexual fist, kinky.<br /> <br /> Aw, Meteor Fist Meditation only let you pop up Adamantine Fists of Battle and not Ascendance Battle Visage, I guess the only way to instant Oni is ripping out someone heart as sacrifice after all. ALL HAIL THE UNCONQUERED SUN!!!<br /> <br /> The capstone is nice, but the Brawler in my party also has Death Ray sooooo making a fortress wall disappears once per story doesn\u2019t have that much oomph for me, I wish it would enhance Heaven-Thunder Hammer to uppercut the opponent into the sun though, or something that would help me RIP OUT THE OPPONENT HEART FOR THE SUN!!! PRAISE THE KING OF HEAVEN!! Ah, rip out the opponent heart for the sun, why must you be so awesome, now I can\u2019t properly look at other Brawl charms without making comparison.<br /> <br /> Conclusion: Synapse said that I would like this Artifact and it\u2019s true! The charm tree is short which is a shame, the but the effects are so so very good, really thematically tight (like the Gauntlet\u2019s abs, if it\u2019s ever have a human form). The final charm is a little underwhelming, but that because it has to compete with Death Ray and RIP OUT THE OPPONENT HEART FOR THE SUN! But it\u2019s okay, I\u2019ll let Heaven and Earth carrying me around Creation in his huge arms and bicep anytime. BEEFCAKE RATING!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bHZIxaW.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-19T09:52:57-07:00","id":1236808,"title":"","content":"I think the stories tend to be personal because the Artifacts tend to be very singular things in use, but there are a few examples involving the participation of allies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-19T19:44:09-07:00","id":1236985,"title":"","content":"Poor Jen. Have you already forgotten Courante and Galliard?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-19T22:26:28-07:00","id":1237028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1236985#post1236985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Poor Jen. Have you already forgotten Courante and Galliard?</div> </div> </div> </div>But they still fit the model of &quot;Artifact holder fights against behemoth with no teammate nor army&quot; though, it's just this time it's a paired weapon and thus two holders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T04:36:05-07:00","id":1237080,"title":"","content":"Well, the legends of artifacts understandably tend to focus on the deeds of their wielders - that doesn't mean they didn't have backup. We know that the wielder of the Heaven and Earth Gauntlets shattered the fortress of the Flying Devil Kings, but we don't know if he beat them all to death, or if this was the only notable thing to happen during the battle.<br /> <br /> Granted, the Broken Blade Concordat was pre-Usurpation, so that guy was a First Age Solar. It's also quite possible he didn't need a team.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T08:38:33-07:00","id":1237162,"title":"","content":"I haven't play in an actual game before, but are Dawn that strong? I always think that taking on a behemoth critter would required a whole Circle at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T09:21:54-07:00","id":1237172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1237162#post1237162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven't play in an actual game before, but are Dawn that strong? I always think that taking on a behemoth critter would required a whole Circle at least.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking from my experience, a solidly-built, experienced Dawn with a smart, creative player <i>can</i> fight a behemoth alone... but there's no <i>certainty </i>of victory. Even when you're sitting at Essence 5, combat is - at its core - an inherently unsafe system.<br /> <br /> If you're going to make a career of monster-fighting, you'd do well to have an adoring Twilight make a warstrider for you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 07-20-2018, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T09:43:14-07:00","id":1237181,"title":"","content":"To be fair, he didn't knock it out with a single blow, we only know that he diverted the path of Mount Mostath from a village with a single blow. which the artifact explicitly enables him to do (knocking a creature of Legendary Size back up to three range bands.) You can do that without an artifact too (if you have..Pretty much all the Feat of Strength charms in Athletics (up to Nine Aeons Thew) and Heaven Thunder Hammer.<br /> <br /> If you think Mount Mostath has some kind of hypothetical Even More Legendary Size merit (I mean, it's clearly way bigger than a Tyrant Lizard) you might need Nine Aeons Thew AND the artifact, but yeah, a suitably high-essence Dawn can probably knock him away. At which point he gets back up, lets out a low and rumbling &quot;the fuck was that?!&quot; and continues plodding along.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-23T09:11:28-07:00","id":1248862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1202960-a-sfw-thread-where-i-read-arms-of-the-chosen-to-find-the-perfect-sword-boyfriend?p=1203813#post1203813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Suggested resource:<br /> <br /> Witchblade, I honestly only interested in the series when the character is a man, okay, that sounds super sexism. But I just want to look at a super ripped dude having his cloths being....well....ripped apart by a sentient skintight armor. Please don't judge me....<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div><br 